{"src":"en","tgt":"ur","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ur","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7709.244932,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":11345.887021,"text":"اگر آپ نے فلم “نیشنل ٹریجر” دیکھی ہے، تو آپ شاید یہ سوچیں گے کہ آزادی کے اعلامیے کے پچھلے حصے پر کوئی خزانے کا نقشہ لکھا ہوا تھا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":11537.931848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11543.184936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":11547.854403000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11553.022042,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11558.425458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11563.751965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11566.328745,"samples":21566,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":13871.311809,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":16984.378647999998,"text":"یہ ہاٹ چاکلیٹ بیلجیم کے معیارات کے مطابق ہے۔ پھلوں کے جوس مہنگے ہوتے ہیں، لیکن تھوڑی دیر بعد آپ ان کی میٹھاہٹ کا ذائقہ محسوس کر سکیں گے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":17184.565708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17189.317703999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17195.078274,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17200.674576999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17205.498131,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17210.873558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17215.23581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17215.88726,"samples":8860,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":22204.517505,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":25137.860174999998,"text":"تاہم، یہ سچ نہیں ہے۔ اگرچہ دستاویز کے پچھلے حصے پر کچھ لکھا ہوا ہے، لیکن یہ کوئی خزانے کا نقشہ نہیں ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":25289.966275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25295.552356999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25301.017352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25306.841601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25311.688865999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25316.750036999998,"samples":29535,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"input","t":29975.533394,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":33990.390598,"text":"آپ اپنے ملک کے علاوہ دیگر حکومتوں کے مشورے سے بھی رہنمائی لینا چاہ سکتے ہیں، لیکن ان کے مشورے ان کے شہریوں کے لیے تیار کیے گئے ہوتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":34178.589844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34183.809562999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34188.785554999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34194.119952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":34199.109875,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34204.772026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34209.154107999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34209.601990999996,"samples":7467,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":41276.611252999995,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":44605.523988,"text":"ہانگ کانگ جزیرہ ہی ہانگ کانگ کے علاقے کو اس نام سے موسوم کرتا ہے، اور یہ وہ جگہ ہے جسے بہت سے سیاح سب سے اہم سمجھتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":44775.147304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44780.221155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44785.233457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44790.497245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44795.994749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44801.259927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44804.243201,"samples":21287,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":49090.041001,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":53159.228237999996,"text":"جو بھی شخص گرم عرض البلدوں میں یا پہاڑی راستوں سے گاڑی چلانے جا رہا ہے، اسے برف، برفانی تہوں یا برفانی تودوں کے خطرے کو ضرور مدِ نظر رکھنا چاہیے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":53349.361174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53354.318076999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53359.753092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53364.933381999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53370.058121999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53375.233681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53379.247629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53382.097234,"samples":28365,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"input","t":58774.697214,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":61286.891928,"text":"جدائی اور دوبارہ ترکیب سے، تغیرات دونوں گروہوں کے درمیان آگے پیچھے منتقل ہوتے رہتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":61403.794746,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61408.918465999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61414.748515,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61420.393028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61424.05253,"samples":24130,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"input","t":61599.342418,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":62126.147407,"text":"ہر نسل کے ساتھ۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":62163.592253999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":62163.919339,"samples":1225,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":66503.515861,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":68617.81108700001,"text":"حشریات دان اس حشرات کے گروہ کے لیے باضابطہ معنوں میں “بگ” کی اصطلاح استعمال کرتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":68732.081326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68737.073558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68742.437265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68747.379407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68749.80720000001,"samples":16885,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":74686.708795,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":77579.29099000001,"text":"سب سے پہلے، زیادہ تر سوار ایسے جوتے پہنتے ہیں جن میں ہیل ہوتا ہے اور تلہ ہموار اور کافی تنگ ہوتا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":77722.733095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":480,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77727.78605600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"ki