ic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":99261.41991200001,"text":"اٹلانٹک ہریکن سیزن کا تناؤ پیدا کرنے والا طوفان، سب ٹراپیکل اسٹورم جیری،"},{"kind":"audio","t":99366.175998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99371.25898900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99376.576105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99381.655276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":99381.974761,"samples":3232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":100223.09198200001,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":101405.801993,"text":"آج بحر اوقیانوس میں ایک طوفان وجود میں آیا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":101476.518404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101481.452026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101483.199769,"samples":12482,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":107227.089288,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":109288.39152300001,"text":"اسی وجہ سے ہمیں کاروں اور دیگر بہت سے نقل و حمل کے آلات کو تربیت دینی پڑی ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":109396.829062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109402.03538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109407.274218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109412.60478400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109413.20900500001,"samples":7411,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":116606.645829,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":119393.28261200001,"text":"یہ تقریباً 400 عیسوی میں شروع ہوکر کافی عرصے تک جاری رہنے والی عیش و عشرت کی مرکزی جگہ کے طور پر مشہور ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":119548.152432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119553.221462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119558.624807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119563.744877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119569.241121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119571.366527,"samples":13931,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":120738.214728,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121464.776467,"text":"تقریباً 1100 عیسوی تک۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":121517.28310300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121518.855498,"samples":12650,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":127062.33450200001,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":128322.80582400001,"text":"چاند کی سطح چٹانوں اور گرد سے بنی ہے۔ چاند کی بیرونی پرت کو کرسٹ کہا جاتا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":128434.88841500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128440.120813,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":128445.355381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":128450.912064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":128451.21910900001,"samples":1281,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":134203.322189,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":136640.591285,"text":"امریکی انجینئرز کے دستے کے مطابق، چھ انچ بارش سے پہلے سے خراب شدہ حصے تباہ ہو سکتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":136767.69142000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136772.918788,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":136777.964499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136783.284766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136787.47127,"samples":25523,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"input","t":141174.89873400002,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":144450.289618,"text":"خاص طور پر، یہ دعویٰ کیا جاتا ہے کہ مائکرو-تاثرات کی درست تشریح سے یہ جانا جا سکتا ہے کہ کوئی شخص جھوٹ بول رہا ہے یا نہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":144622.861581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144627.890462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":144633.001961,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144638.619843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144644.153106,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144648.227453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144651.442852,"samples":30761,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"input","t":147227.673667,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":148837.735193,"text":"عمارتوں پر نشان لگا کر یا خراشیں ڈال کر اس جگہ کو خراب نہ کریں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":148926.66285700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148931.667709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148936.953896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148937.562416,"samples":7300,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":154863.509899,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":157715.343799,"text":"ببر شیر کی چیخ شیر کی پوری آواز والی چیخ جیسی نہیں ہوتی، بلکہ یہ غصے سے بولے گئے الفاظ کے جملے جیسی ہوتی ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":157884.202859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157889.187471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157894.83625300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157899.674757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157905.157131,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157910.586225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":157910.728893,"samples":1504,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":161904.955028,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":164576.878891,"text":"20ویں صدی کی تحقیقات سے پتا چلا ہے کہ جینیاتی تنوع دو قسم کا ہوتا ہے: چھپا ہوا اور ظاہر ہونے والا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":164703.10116000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":164708.386917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164712.01869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164714.807607,"samples":28755,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":164718.556568,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164720.35219,"samples":19894,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"close","t":174806.916425,"code":1005}]}